TEXT 256 104 Left 2 ;Isolator should be present \nbecause otherwise the voltage\nlevel of the source is transported via the switch\n(roff=1e9 to full voltage level vs\n R=1e6 to zero voltage level)\nWithout the isolator the voltage level of the\noutput of the switch is full voltage even when\nthe switch is off (after 1xON state)\nThe initial off state is however ideal (see modelling the switch)
